{"seq":1,"slug":"proxy-bidding-agent","title":"代理出价（proxy bid）机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/online-auction-marketplace/proxy-bid-anti-snipe/proxy-bidding-agent","wordCount":1799,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"代理出价-proxy-bid-机制\">代理出价（proxy bid）机制</h1><p>代理出价解决的是一句很朴素的需求：我不想盯着屏幕加价，你替我出到某个上限为止。它把「公开逐轮叫价」折叠成「一次性录入上限 + 服务端增量裁决」，从而把实时广播问题转成了并发一致性问题。折叠带来了两个新的难点：<strong>上限必须绝对保密</strong>（它一旦泄露，对手可以直接卡在你上限之下），以及<strong>增量裁决必须可重放</strong>（同一串出价事件在任何时刻重放都要得出同一个当前价）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>代理出价的定义在文献里很精确：它是「一个迭代式的密封出价拍卖，赢家按超过次高价的固定增量付款」，竞买人各自录入一个秘密的最高可接受价，当前最高价保密、次高价公开，系统只把展示价抬到刚好击败领先者的水平（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Auction_sniping\">Wikipedia, Auction sniping</a>）。注意这句话里的两个「价」是两回事：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>名称</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>可见性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>出价上限 max_amount</td>\n<td>竞买人真实愿付的最高价</td>\n<td>仅本人可见</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>当前价 current_price</td>\n<td>系统展示的、需要被击败的价格</td>\n<td>全员可见</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>次高上限 second_max</td>\n<td>第二高的出价上限</td>\n<td>不可见，但决定了当前价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>领先者 leader</td>\n<td>当前上限最高者</td>\n<td>全员可见</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>展示价由次高上限驱动：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>current</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>highest_max</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> second_max</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>inc</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{current} = \\min(\\text{highest\\_max},\\ \\text{second\\_max} + \\text{inc})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">current</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">highest_max</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">second_max</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">inc</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。这条式子是整个机制的心脏——它解释了为什么代理出价的成交价通常就是「次高上限加一档」，也解释了为什么泄露上限等于把对手的成交价送上门。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[竞买人录入上限 M] --&gt; B{与现有最高上限 H 比较}&#10;  B --&gt;|M &gt; H| C[新出价者成为领先者]&#10;  B --&gt;|M &lt;= H| D[原领先者保持]&#10;  C --&gt; E[current = min M, H + inc]&#10;  D --&gt; F{现有次高上限 S}&#10;  F --&gt; G[current = min H, M + inc]&#10;  E --&gt; H[写回聚合并广播]&#10;  G --&gt; H\">graph TD\n  A[竞买人录入上限 M] --&gt; B{与现有最高上限 H 比较}\n  B --&gt;|M &gt; H| C[新出价者成为领先者]\n  B --&gt;|M &lt;= H| D[原领先者保持]\n  C --&gt; E[current = min M, H + inc]\n  D --&gt; F{现有次高上限 S}\n  F --&gt; G[current = min H, M + inc]\n  E --&gt; H[写回聚合并广播]\n  G --&gt; H</pre><h2 id=\"增量裁决的算法\">增量裁决的算法</h2><h3 id=\"朴素做法为什么错\">朴素做法为什么错</h3><p>「读当前最高上限，加一档，写回」在并发下必然出错：两个同时到达的代理会读到同一个旧值，各自加一档，后写者覆盖先写者，拍卖少收一档、甚至丢掉一个领先者。正确做法是把裁决压进数据库的条件更新，或者用一个单写者串行队列。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"WITH ranked AS (&#10;  SELECT bidder_id, max_amount,&#10;         row_number() OVER (&#10;           ORDER BY max_amount DESC, created_at ASC&#10;         ) AS rk&#10;    FROM bid&#10;   WHERE auction_id = :id AND kind = &#39;proxy&#39;&#10;)&#10;UPDATE auction a&#10;   SET leader_id     = (SELECT bidder_id FROM ranked WHERE rk = 1),&#10;       current_price = LEAST(&#10;         (SELECT max_amount  FROM ranked WHERE rk = 1),&#10;         (SELECT max_amount  FROM ranked WHERE rk = 2) + :inc&#10;       ),&#10;       version = version + 1&#10; WHERE a.auction_id = :id&#10;   AND a.version = :expected_version&#10;   AND a.status = &#39;running&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ranked </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bidder_id, max_amount,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         row_number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> max_amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, created_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ASC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">         ) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rk</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bid</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> auction_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> kind </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'proxy'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> auction a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> leader_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bidder_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ranked </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rk </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       current_price </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> LEAST</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">         (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> max_amount  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ranked </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rk </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">         (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> max_amount  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ranked </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rk </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :inc</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">auction_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :expected_version</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'running'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>ORDER BY max_amount DESC, created_at ASC</code> 里的第二个排序键是并列打破规则：两个竞买人上限相同时，先提交者保持领先。这条规则必须固定，否则重放会得出不同结果。</p>\n<h3 id=\"并列与边界情形\">并列与边界情形</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>情形</th>\n<th>裁决</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>新上限 &gt; 当前最高上限</td>\n<td>新来者领先，价 = min(新上限, 旧上限 + 幅度)</td>\n<td>标准代理抬价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新上限 = 当前最高上限</td>\n<td>先提交者领先，价保持</td>\n<td>时间优先，价款不变</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新上限 &lt; 当前最高上限</td>\n<td>原领先者仍领先，价 = min(最高上限, 新上限 + 幅度)</td>\n<td>抬价但仍落后</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新上限 &lt; 当前价 + 幅度</td>\n<td>拒绝，返回「需高于 X」</td>\n<td>违反加价幅度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行是最容易漏的：竞买人录入的上限虽然高于当前价，但不足以完成一档加价时，必须明确拒绝并告知所需门槛，而不是默默接受一个无效的代理，见 <a href=\"../auction-format-engine/start-reserve-bid-increment\">起拍价、保留价与加价幅度</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"惰性裁决与急切裁决\">惰性裁决与急切裁决</h3><p>系统有两种时机选择。<strong>急切裁决</strong>（每次录入立刻抬价到极限）实现简单、状态始终自洽，但会暴露信息——对手能从抬价速度推断你的上限区间。<strong>惰性裁决</strong>（只在必要时才算价）更贴近「迭代式密封拍卖」的语义、信息泄露更少，但要求每次读取时都重算，读路径变重。主流平台偏向急切裁决，因为它让「当前价」成为一个可以直接读出的物化值，代价是必须严格控制谁能看到抬价明细。</p>\n<h2 id=\"上限的保密与信息泄露面\">上限的保密与信息泄露面</h2><h3 id=\"泄露通道清单\">泄露通道清单</h3><p>上限保密不是「不返回这个字段」就完事。真实的泄露面通常更长：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>通道</th>\n<th>泄露内容</th>\n<th>防护</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>出价列表接口</td>\n<td>每笔出价金额 = 抬价轨迹</td>\n<td>只返回被击败的价，不返回上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>抬价通知</td>\n<td>「你被超过了」的时刻与幅度</td>\n<td>合并通知、不附带精确差额</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>竞买人自身上限回显</td>\n<td>用户界面直接展示他人上限</td>\n<td>仅返回调用者自己的上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代理引擎错误信息</td>\n<td>「你的上限低于 X」里的 X</td>\n<td>只返回最低可接受门槛，不返回对手上限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"上限与异常检测\">上限与异常检测</h3><p>上限本身是敏感数据，但它的<strong>统计分布</strong>是风控的重要输入。一个只录入极低上限却总能领先的账号、一批上限数值高度雷同的账号，都是围标线索，见 <a href=\"../auction-fraud-ops/shill-bid-rig-detect\">托儿、围标与操纵识别</a>。设计时要明确：风控可以读取上限，但读取路径必须走审计、且不得把原始值写入常规日志。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;visibility&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;max_amount&quot;: &quot;owner_only&quot;,&#10;    &quot;current_price&quot;: &quot;public&quot;,&#10;    &quot;bid_history&quot;: &quot;public_amounts_only&quot;,&#10;    &quot;outbid_notice&quot;: { &quot;include_delta&quot;: false, &quot;debounce_ms&quot;: 5000 }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;audit&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;read_max_amount&quot;: [&quot;fraud_review&quot;, &quot;self&quot;],&#10;    &quot;log_raw_value&quot;: false,&#10;    &quot;log_sink&quot;: &quot;audit_ledger&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"visibility\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"max_amount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"owner_only\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"current_price\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"public\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"bid_history\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"public_amounts_only\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"outbid_notice\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"include_delta\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"debounce_ms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"audit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"read_max_amount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"fraud_review\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"self\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"log_raw_value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"log_sink\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"audit_ledger\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"可重放性与一致性\">可重放性与一致性</h2><p>代理出价的全部状态都可以由「上限集合 + 到达顺序」重建，这是它最大的工程优点：任何时刻都可以从事件流重算当前价并与物化值比对。</p>\n<h3 id=\"重放不变量\">重放不变量</h3><ul>\n<li>同一 auction 的上限集合与到达顺序确定唯一的 leader 与 current_price；</li>\n<li>current_price 永不超过 highest_max；</li>\n<li>current_price 永不低于 start_price（首笔出价允许等于起拍价）；</li>\n<li>撤出最高上限后，current_price 必须回落到由剩余上限重算的值，而不是停留在原位——这条与撤回规则强相关，见 <a href=\"bid-withdraw-rule\">出价撤回与有效规则</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"与第二价格机制的等价\">与第二价格机制的等价</h3><p>代理出价的最优策略是如实录入自己的真实上限，这正是第二价格密封拍卖的占优策略：如实报价既不会让你赢在亏损价位，也不会让你错过本可盈利的成交（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vickrey_auction\">Wikipedia, Vickrey auction</a>）。工程上这条结论有一个直接用途：<strong>平台不需要、也不应该引导用户「少报一点」</strong>，任何提示用户压价的产品文案都在破坏机制的策略性质。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>不变量</th>\n<th>违反时的症状</th>\n<th>检测手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>唯一 leader</td>\n<td>同一拍卖出现两个领先者</td>\n<td>重放比对</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>price ≤ highest_max</td>\n<td>成交价高于真实上限</td>\n<td>日终对账</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>撤出后回落</td>\n<td>价格虚高、无对应上限支撑</td>\n<td>重放比对</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>幅度校验</td>\n<td>出现小于一档的加价</td>\n<td>出价表约束</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>代理出价把英式拍卖折叠成「一次录入上限 + 服务端增量裁决」，当前价由次高上限驱动：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>current</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>highest</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> second</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>inc</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{current}=\\min(\\text{highest},\\ \\text{second}+\\text{inc})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">current</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">highest</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">second</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">inc</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>增量裁决必须走条件更新或单写者串行，读-改-写必然在并发下丢更新。</li>\n<li>并列时以提交时间打破，规则必须固定以保证重放一致。</li>\n<li>上限保密要覆盖出价列表、抬价通知、错误信息三条泄露通道；风控读取上限必须走审计且不落常规日志。</li>\n<li>代理出价的最优策略是如实录入上限，与第二价格密封拍卖的占优策略等价。</li>\n<li>全部状态可由「上限集合 + 到达顺序」重放，物化值必须与重放结果持续比对。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"代理出价（proxy bid）机制","id":"代理出价-proxy-bid-机制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"增量裁决的算法","id":"增量裁决的算法"},{"level":3,"text":"朴素做法为什么错","id":"朴素做法为什么错"},{"level":3,"text":"并列与边界情形","id":"并列与边界情形"},{"level":3,"text":"惰性裁决与急切裁决","id":"惰性裁决与急切裁决"},{"level":2,"text":"上限的保密与信息泄露面","id":"上限的保密与信息泄露面"},{"level":3,"text":"泄露通道清单","id":"泄露通道清单"},{"level":3,"text":"上限与异常检测","id":"上限与异常检测"},{"level":2,"text":"可重放性与一致性","id":"可重放性与一致性"},{"level":3,"text":"重放不变量","id":"重放不变量"},{"level":3,"text":"与第二价格机制的等价","id":"与第二价格机制的等价"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"起拍价、保留价与加价幅度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/online-auction-marketplace/auction-format-engine/start-reserve-bid-increment"},"next":{"title":"反狙击自动延时","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/online-auction-marketplace/proxy-bid-anti-snipe/anti-sniping-time-extend"}}